    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Grandparents on both sides",
     "texto": [
      "**爷爷** and **奶奶** are the paternal grandfather and grandmother; **外公** and **外婆**, the maternal ones. **叔叔** is the paternal uncle and **阿姨**, the aunt or an adult woman. In English, kinship words also do not usually show by themselves which side of the family someone is on."
     ],
